 drives:{name:'Front drive bays',what:'Carriers and backplanes connect persistent local storage to the server.',design:'R770 has different SFF and E3.S configurations. A controller, backplane and chassis must support the chosen drives; this diagram shows a functional group rather than an exact bay count.',src:'r770'},
