 blade:{name:'PowerEdge MX compute sled',what:'A removable server with its own CPUs, memory, local drives and management controller.',design:'MX760c is a full-height, single-width sled. Up to eight fit in MX7000. Qualified mezzanine adapters connect the sled to the chassis fabrics.',src:'mxfront'},
 iom:{name:'MX fabric I/O modules',what:'Rear switch or pass-through modules connect sled adapters toward external networks or storage fabrics.',design:'MX7000 provides redundant A/B fabric bays and storage fabric C bays. The two boxes shown represent a simplified network fabric pair, not all six I/O bays.',src:'frame'},
 omem:{name:'MX9002m / OME-Modular',what:'Chassis management modules run OpenManage Enterprise–Modular.',design:'Up to two redundant modules supervise the chassis, sleds, I/O, power and cooling. The purple connection represents management of the sleds; application traffic uses the I/O fabric.',src:'omem'},
