 host:{name:'XE9680 host CPUs and RAM',what:'The host runs the operating system, feeds work to accelerators and handles surrounding application tasks.',design:'XE9680 uses two qualified Intel Xeon Scalable CPUs and 32 DDR5 DIMMs. Host RAM is separate from each accelerator’s HBM.',src:'xe9680'},
 gpu:{name:'Eight-accelerator subsystem',what:'Accelerators carry out parallel computation using their own local high-bandwidth memory.',design:'XE9680 supports separate NVIDIA H100/H200, AMD MI300X or Intel Gaudi 3 builds. The eight boxes represent one homogeneous qualified subsystem. The internal links differ and are not drawn as an interchangeable fabric.',src:'xe9680'},
